{"text": " I think it was never about the achievements for me because at the end of the day, there will be a new Olympic champion in the 100 press and there was already a new Olympic champion in the 200 press. So I think if you become the sport, it can really eat at you because no one likes losing. And sometimes if that is you, you immediately think that you are a loser. And that's the thing that's going to last is how you treat people, how you are with people, not this gold medal. This is going into a box and no one's going to see it again and we're never going to speak about it. But it's how you are with people that make the impact. So I was grateful to have a platform to be able to reach more people and for them to experience who I am as a person. And yeah, you hope that people support you and are there because of the person you stand for. And I think I can say that to those other athletes, it's just the sport is only a season. You're not going to do it until you're 80 years old. So for me, it was 27 years and now that season has come to an end and now I'm the person I've created myself in swimming and the challenges are faced and the character building there and is now going to carry me into the next season. Thank you very much.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 20.199999999999996, "end": 24.44, "text": " I think it was never about the achievements for me because at the end of the day,", "tokens": [50364, 286, 519, 309, 390, 1128, 466, 264, 21420, 337, 385, 570, 412, 264, 917, 295, 264, 786, 11, 51586], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.37935924530029297, "compression_ratio": 1.0945945945945945, "no_speech_prob": 0.23684272170066833, "words": [{"word": " I", "start": 20.199999999999996, "end": 20.599999999999998, "probability": 0.3776419162750244}, {"word": " think", "start": 20.599999999999998, "end": 21.0, "probability": 0.9852617383003235}, {"word": " it", "start": 21.0, "end": 21.14, "probability": 0.9822478890419006}, {"word": " was", "start"